  ('Physics', 'AQA', 'gcse', '4.3', 'Particle Model of Matter', 'Calculate the density of a 200 g block with volume 100 cm³.', '200 ÷ 100 = 2 g/cm³.', 3),
  ('Physics', 'AQA', 'gcse', '4.3', 'Particle Model of Matter', 'How can the density of an irregular object be found?', 'Measure its mass with a balance and its volume by displacement of water in a measuring cylinder.', 4),
  ('Physics', 'AQA', 'gcse', '4.3', 'Particle Model of Matter', 'What is the particle arrangement in a solid?', 'Particles are closely packed in a regular pattern, vibrating about fixed positions.', 5),
